mpv dynamically loads these FFmpeg libraries for media processing. The small
ffmpeg.exe command-line front end uses the same libraries and is included for
media conversion and export features. FFmpeg and its libraries remain separate
from the LunaPlayer executable and may be replaced with compatible builds.

This shared x86-64-v2 build enables GPL components and version 3 of the licence
(--enable-gpl --enable-version3). Corresponding source and build instructions,
including the additional codec and disc-reader dependencies, are available from
the source project and build revision linked above.


